  "instructions": [
    "Heat the lard or vegetable oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Sauté the diced onion and minced garlic until softened, about 3-4 minutes.",
    "Add the diced chili peppers and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Stir in the ground cumin and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chickpea flour and stir to combine, cooking for 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the ferment-jang and stir to combine, cooking for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Stir in the enzyme-rich kimchi and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Season with salt to taste.",
    "Warm the flour tortillas by wrapping them in a damp paper towel and microwaving for 20-30 seconds.",
    "Assemble the tacos by spooning the ferment-jang mixture onto a warmed tortilla and topping with chopped cilantro and a squeeze of lime juice.",
    "Serve immediately in lacquerware bowls."
  ],
